[Music]  today we're introducing two of the six  new classes in van helsing 3 the flood  estonia and the amber list the  phlogiston air is a hunter dedicated for  more destructive aspects of a weird  science he is protected by his heavy  exoskeleton equipped with deadly  explosives the amber list is a fighter  who studied the arcane manipulation of  shadows  and relies on stealth and surprise  attacks to inflict substantial damage in  the blink of an eye to do so he will use  shadow sigils that can either boost his  damage or cloak him again to prepare for  another ambush let's see how they fare  in various combat situations when you're  facing enemies from the distances are  phlogiston here you can lay down a  minefield in advance and swarm you're  approaching enemies with rockets should  they survive that you can easily blast  them away with a devastating rain of  projectiles when you players number list  you should sneak up close and use the  blink assault your attacks will receive  a huge damage bonus after you shed your  cloak of Shadows when it comes to  sustaining damage the phlogiston e'er  has it easy  his interceptive forcefield provides a  defense boost and recharges between  battles the force field can be improved  by different masteries so for example  you can make it explode when it  fully depleted the under list on the  other hand is more vulnerable so you  should avoid getting hit at all costs  luckily he can always switch back to his  life stealing abilities by using shadow  bust if the situation gets too risky the  under list can summon shadow warriors to  fight while he vanishes from sight if  you are surrounded by enemies as a flop  dystonia you have a number of  destructive choices incinerate your foes  with your flamethrower or blast them all  away with an artillery strike as a  number list you should get away from  these situations by using trail of  darkness then jump right back into the  battle with a shadow jolt spell to  freeze your foes also if you kill your  enemies in one hit you consume your  shadows sigils and you get cloaked  instantly to prepare for another stealth  attack as a phlogiston ear you will  stand strong in the fight with your wide  array of mines rockets and protective  force field and the amethyst will strike  her same fear into the hearts of his  enemies destroy them all  [Music]

